From 88ef4e2dbf7d9f3558a1e8558506c87f6e4a5f89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 11:18:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(i18n): localize analytics screen (de/en/uk)

The analytics screen was hardcoded German, so EN/UK users saw German
there. Route header and AnalyticsView now resolve all user-facing strings
via useI18n()/t(); translation keys for all three locales added to
messages.ts. Chart configs, tab labels, tooltips, metric hints, empty
states and the ACWR zone labels are covered. Date formatting follows the
active locale. SEO <head> meta stays German (runs outside the provider).
No data-pipeline or chart logic changed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WwagmzvYAcqWRzAJyQX1hV
